      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1941504289672757750",
      "text": "[3:22PM] #MobolajiBankAnthonyWay #TrafficUpdate \n\n Along the service lane from Anthony heading towards the Maryland intersection and further towards Odo'yalaro, traffic is currently heavy. Conversely, the situation at the Maryland intersection itself, including both inward and outward movements on Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, is experiencing a smooth flow of traffic. \n\nSimilarly, Kodesoh Road is also reporting good traffic movement in both inward and outward directions. Furthermore, commuters on Oba Akran Road and Bridge, Local Airport Road and Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way, and within Ikeja G.R.A. are encountering a good flow of traffic. Despite the moderate congestion in certain areas, traffic personnel are actively managing their designated posts to maintain a steady movement.\n\n Overall, there are no reported obstructions or impediments affecting traffic flow within these areas. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
