    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1941509622872805691",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1941509622872805691",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1941509622872805691",
      "text": "[3:45PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\n Movement is slow descending from the CMS bridge towards the Offin Canal market due to significant market activity and the associated vehicular movement in and out of the area. However, immediately after the Offin Canal market stretch, traffic flow improves considerably towards Ijora Olopa by the NEPA intersection.\n\nAlong Broad Street, traffic is moving steadily towards Apongbon underneath the bridge, facilitating connections to the Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo areas. Eko Bridge also reports good traffic movement inward towards Apongbon, connecting efficiently with CMS.\n\nFor those descending the Idumota bridge towards Ebute-Ero, traffic flow is also good, extending through Leventis and the UBA roundabout, allowing for smooth transit to both the inner and outer Marina areas. Currently, there are no reported impediments, and personnel are present to manage traffic flow effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
