      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1941525358639022119",
      "text": "[4:47PM] #LagosIsland #Olowu #TrafficUpdate \n\n Traffic movement from the Adekunle intersection on the 3rd Mainland Bridge, flows steadily inward Adeniji Adele Road, extending through the Ilubirin and Sura junctions down to the Obalende Bridge. This steady flow continues towards Onikan, descending towards the Flag House en route to the CMS Bridge and subsequently connecting to Apongbon.\n\nThe Apongbon Bridge descending towards Outer Marina and inward to CMS, leading to the Train Station, is also currently reporting good traffic flow. From the Nitel junction towards the State House, traffic moves appreciably through the McWen Bridge by Officers Mess down to Bonny Camp.\n\nFor those ascending the Obalende Bridge towards the Dolphin intersection, Emergency point and further inward to Ilubirin, traffic flows smoothly down to the Carter Bridge exit. This allows for a good connection back to the 3rd Mainland Bridge for those journeying inward Iyana Oworo. \nNo impediments are currently reported, and our officers are actively managing traffic flow. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
